// with a bearer token). The mTLS listener keeps client certificates.
//
// A web session needs a password and a TOTP code. Login returns a pending
// token that is good for five minutes and only for the second-factor RPCs.
// An operator without TOTP must enroll before the first session is issued.
// Send tokens as `authorization: Bearer <token>`.
